<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-28T05:59:35.563Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:59:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has deployed roughly 1,000 troops to Haiti after four Salvadoran aviation technicians were kidnapped in a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince, and the president says bodies found are not those hostages. Haitian gangs have intensified attacks, prompting UN-backed troops to suffer a major assault that left dozens dead, while the Dominican Republic has reinforced its southern border in response. Heavy rains have triggered flooding and landslides that killed four people in Haiti, adding a humanitarian shock to the security crisis. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPV1FsRG13WUFFS1B2SUUwZ0prZzlWX1I2NE9jT2pqY0w3RWNoMG14NVIyWlVrNG4yZ0x0WFBBRXRFQkRaY0U1ZWlhdzRqZHZWWWhyRG9MNzBkQllQejE3U2RteWF1VU1nWk1FS1YtakRKSk9HV0otNGNlUUhSRVp4WlRZMWx4TmloUkF5anlWS0JPTWNTN1cxQVpJOTBhQ283dTBvMlJFZnlUUGVKQWNqdDFRZnVFS0Z0WnFxUktPR1R4VDFW?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPX3A0Z2dMclpLeWNSOTRfeVh3cXhTMWhnRnpwNEhnaXZXWl8tV3BKOFFZN25pWWtYS3NlNnRkd3FET0RhWlhPcFVNckQ1RW5sMldrRjQtMzY0ZDhJaXlDeDBsT1NsUF95NjFqRUFldXV2S055SjZkUjh1d2c2a3cwQjQwd1FEU1JNY1dXR3pwdUl1Uks0aWpUSXN6RFM0QzJ6VFBqb0F2YUhJa2ZfQ0ZOWHM0Mk5LckRv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPN3N0enNCa0pOSjQzZ0ZLcmJtZEdvY0JFNl95NkRWSkZOUGkwb0FLTmRCOWRGVEthTE1OZ0NHbjZkOUNMRFA3LU8tR1NSUVFwRVYybVl4N28ydjRGVU9sWUFWdF8xZE0zZzRwekE4UHpURnFLZjNmVnRCNURtOFhaOTh2bmQtcEN1MXdnS05HYVg3OVNQVDVVOFVUclVFMzQ0N1h0dnVydmsyT2hBNFY2bzFkd0xfNElWWGc4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPaUVfcHo5QnJBR1pkQ0swOEcxQnZYQW9uLXVxWURpUkUxdGhwOXhsSXNWd0g2NGdzd2FmQVY2Wk5YcjZtSS1TWXVvNEJ